<ServiceDetail
  metaTitle="Pediatric Feeding & Swallowing Therapy in Los Angeles"
  metaDescription="Feeding therapy for picky eaters and children with swallowing challenges at TheraPlay LA. Root-cause evaluation across sensory, motor, and airway factors."
